","status_notes":"The QMP migrate command injection lives in the qemu-system monitor protocol. cdi-importer does not include qemu-system, does not start a QMP listener, and does not run VM migrations; only qemu-utils binaries (qemu-img, qemu-nbd) are invoked, none of which expose QMP.","justification":"component_not_present","timestamp":"2026-04-17T21:26:59.43Z"},{"@id":"b8c89c6e-a899-4ba3-a24b-b75ccc5b6d36","vulnerability":{"name":"CVE-2019-12247"},"products":[{"@id":"pkg:deb/debian/qemu"},{"@id":"pkg:deb/debian/qemu@1%3A10.0.8%2Bds-0%2Bdeb13u1"},{"@id":"pkg:deb/debian/qemu@1%3A10.0.8%2Bds-0%2Bdeb13u1?os_distro=trixie\u0026os_name=debian\u0026os_version=13"}],"status":"not_affected","status_notes":"The integer overflow is in the QEMU Guest Agent (qga) command handlers. cdi-importer does not install qemu-guest-agent and never runs inside a guest VM; only qemu-utils is present. The qga code path is not reachable.","justification":"component_not_present","timestamp":"2026-04-17T21:26:58.599Z"},{"@id":"3610b1af-fb9f-4061-bf7a-1e739690ad79","vulnerability":{"name":"CVE-2022-36648"},"products":[{"@id":"pkg:deb/debian/qemu"},{"@id":"pkg:deb/debian/qemu@1%3A10.0.8%2Bds-0%2Bdeb13u1"},{"@id":"pkg:deb/debian/qemu@1%3A10.0.8%2Bds-0%2Bdeb13u1?os_distro=trixie\u0026os_name=debian\u0026os_version=13"}],"status":"not_affected","status_notes":"The flaw is in the QEMU rocker virtual switch device, exposed only by qemu-system when emulating that hardware for a guest VM. cdi-importer ships qemu-utils only (qemu-img, qemu-nbd, qemu-storage-daemon, qemu-io) for disk image conversion; it does not include or invoke any qemu-system binary, so the rocker code path is not present at runtime.","justification":"component_not_present","timestamp":"2026-04-17T21:26:57.56Z"},{"@id":"92c893d7-4b5b-4062-80a9-9f60374d9ebc","vulnerability":{"name":"CVE-2019-12929"},"products":[{"@id":"pkg:deb/debian/qemu"},{"@id":"pkg:deb/debian/qemu@1%3A10.0.8%2Bds-0%2Bdeb13u1"},{"@id":"pkg:deb/debian/qemu@1%3A10.0.8%2Bds-0%2Bdeb13u1?os_distro=trixie\u0026os_name=debian\u0026os_version=13"}],"status":"not_affected","status_notes":"The QMP guest_exec command injection lives in the qemu-system monitor protocol. cdi-importer does not include qemu-system, does not start a QMP listener, and never invokes guest_exec; only qemu-utils binaries (qemu-img, qemu-nbd) are present and none expose QMP.","justification":"component_not_present","timestamp":"2026-04-17T21:26:57.017Z"},{"@id":"3ea2e5ea-1525-4b3c-92c8-3cf63b8cadfc","vulnerability":{"name":"CVE-2019-12928"},"products":[{"@id":"pkg:deb/debian/qemu"},{"@id":"pkg:deb/debian/qemu@1%3A10.0.8%2Bds-0%2Bdeb13u1"},{"@id":"pkg:deb/debian/qemu@1%3A10.0.8%2Bds-0%2Bdeb13u1?os_distro=trixie\u0026os_name=debian\u0026os_version=13"}],"status":"not_affected","status_notes":"The QMP migrate command injection lives in the qemu-system monitor protocol. cdi-importer does not include qemu-system, does not start a QMP listener, and does not run VM migrations; only qemu-utils binaries (qemu-img, qemu-nbd) are invoked, none of which expose QMP.","justification":"component_not_present","timestamp":"2026-04-17T21:26:56.183Z"},{"@id":"7d3114d6-9d0d-40f1-8686-301a5e594e56","vulnerability":{"name":"CVE-2019-12247"},"products":[{"@id":"pkg:deb/debian/qemu"},{"@id":"pkg:deb/debian/qemu@1%3A10.0.8%2Bds-0%2Bdeb13u1"},{"@id":"pkg:deb/debian/qemu@1%3A10.0.8%2Bds-0%2Bdeb13u1?os_distro=trixie\u0026os_name=debian\u0026os_version=13"}],"status":"not_affected","status_notes":"The integer overflow is in the QEMU Guest Agent (qga) command handlers. cdi-importer does not install qemu-guest-agent and never runs inside a guest VM; only qemu-utils is present. The qga code path is not reachable.","justification":"component_not_present","timestamp":"2026-04-17T21:26:55.257Z"},{"@id":"0e137c11-589e-47bf-8fa7-c75295e4708e","vulnerability":{"name":"CVE-2022-36648"},"products":[{"@id":"pkg:deb/debian/qemu"},{"@id":"pkg:deb/debian/qemu@1%3A10.0.8%2Bds-0%2Bdeb13u1"},{"@id":"pkg:deb/d